{"id":"ae0e85fc0e149930","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-bound-variable.md","title":"Bound Variable","display":"df-bound-variable — Bound Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-bound-variable","aliases":["88-df-bound-variable"],"display":"df-bound-variable — Bound Variable","depends_on":["[[88-df-formula]]","[[88-df-free-variable]]","[[88-df-variable]]","[[88-df-atomic-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-bound-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-bound-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bound-variable — Bound Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9df3c26c280af75a\" href=\"?note=9df3c26c280af75a\" title=\"88-df-atomic-formula\">88-df-atomic-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in \\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x \\in \\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (variable, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bound}(x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bound}(x,\\varphi)\\)</span> (bound-variable predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bound}_S:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\">\\(\\mathrm{bound}_S:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\)</span> (bound-variable map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span> (atomic-formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9df3c26c280af75a\" href=\"?note=9df3c26c280af75a\" title=\"88-df-atomic-formula\">88-df-atomic-formula</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bound\\text{-}variable} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;(\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\theta)=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\neg\\varphi)=\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\varphi))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\psi))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\varphi)\\cup\n(\\{x\\}\\cap\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Bound}(x,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\varphi)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bound\\text{-}variable} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;(\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\theta)=\\emptyset)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\neg\\varphi)=\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\varphi))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\psi))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n(\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\varphi)\\cup\n(\\{x\\}\\cap\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Bound}(x,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\varphi)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bound}(x, \\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bound}(x, \\varphi)\\)</span> : 变量<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>在公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>中被约束</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{bound}_S(\\varphi)\\)</span> : 在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>中至少有一个受量词约束之出现的变量集</li>\n<li>量词只把其辖域中原本自由的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>出现变成约束出现；因此\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,P(y)\">\\(\\forall x\\,P(y)\\)</span>不会凭空把未出现的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>加入该集合。</li>\n<li>约束变量被量词限定</li>\n<li>同一变量可在不同位置既自由又约束</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a> — 自由变量</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a> — 变量集</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a> — 公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" 